      "text": "Using logarithm laws, \\[ \\begin{aligned} \\log125 &=\\log\\left(\\frac{1000}{8}\\right)\\\\ &=3-\\log(2^3)\\\\ &=3-3\\log2. \\end{aligned} \\]\n\nThus, the correct answer is D.",
